### List Speakers
GET http://localhost:5000/api/speakers

### Create Speaker Profile
POST http://localhost:5000/api/speakers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Dr. Priya Sharma",
  "designation": "VP of AI Research",
  "company": "DeepNeural Corp",
  "bio": "Pioneered multi-modal generative agents and decentralized computing.",
  "expertise": ["Artificial Intelligence", "LLM Orchestration"]
}
